msgid "Use `--attn_backend=auto` for priority-ordered selection, or select backend names with `--attn_backend`, `--prefill_attn_backend`, and `--decode_attn_backend`. Exclude named backends with `--disable_attn_backends`. Legacy boolean switches affect automatic selection; see [ServerArgs](server_arguments.md) for deprecated compatibility flags."
